---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LessonCard from '../components/LessonCard.astro';
import { Code } from 'astro:components';
import { LESSONS, PRINCIPLES, ROADMAP } from '../data/site';

const snippet = `// crates/mini-llm-tensor/src/lib.rs
let logits = Tensor::from_2d(2, 3, vec![1., 2., 3., 4., 5., 6.])?;
let probs = logits.softmax_rows()?;   // 每一行的概率之和为 1

// crates/mini-llm-model/src/lib.rs
let (output, weights) = scaled_dot_product_attention(&q, &k, &v)?;
// weights: [query_len, key_len] —— 这就是“注意力”本身
assert_eq!(output.shape(), &[2, 2]);`;
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="shell hero__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Rust · 教学优先 · CPU 参考实现</p>
        <h1 class="hero__title">
          把大模型<em>拆开</em>，<br />
          用 Rust 跑起来。
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__lead">
          mini-llm 不教你调用 API。它从一条 <code>Vec&lt;f32&gt;</code> 开始，把张量、Softmax、注意力和训练循环重新实现一遍——
          <strong>每一步都能运行，每一行都能读懂。</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="hero__actions">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/learn/tensor-shape">
            从张量开始
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/docs">浏览文档</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__facts">
          <span><b>3</b> 个 crate</span>
          <span><b>0</b> unsafe</span>
          <span><b>f32</b> row-major</span>
          <span>M0 骨架已完成</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="console">
          <div class="console__bar">
            <span class="console__dot"></span>
            <span class="console__dot"></span>
            <span class="console__dot"></span>
            <span class="console__title">mini-llm — cargo run</span>
          </div>
          <div class="console__body"><span class="c-prompt">$</span> cargo run -p mini-llm-cli -- demo<br /><span class="c-dim">mini-llm CPU attention demo</span><br />attention weights: [<span class="c-num">0.66976154</span>, <span class="c-num">0.33023846</span>, <span class="c-num">0.33023846</span>, <span class="c-num">0.66976154</span>]<br />output shape: [<span class="c-key">2</span>, <span class="c-key">2</span>]<br />output: [<span class="c-num">6.6976156</span>, <span class="c-num">3.3023846</span>, <span class="c-num">3.3023846</span>, <span class="c-num">6.6976156</span>]</div>

          <div class="console__heat">
            <div class="heat-grid" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="heat-cell" style="--w: 0.67">0.67</span>
              <span class="heat-cell" style="--w: 0.33">0.33</span>
              <span class="heat-cell" style="--w: 0.33">0.33</span>
              <span class="heat-cell" style="--w: 0.67">0.67</span>
            </div>
            <div class="heat-caption">
              <span>attention weights · 2 × 2</span>
              <span>每行 Softmax 后之和为 1.00</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="console__foot">
            <span>v0.1 · CPU 后端</span>
            <a href="/docs/tensor-engine">看看内部实现 →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="principles">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">01 · 设计原则</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">先把原理写清楚，再谈性能</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-note">
          mini-llm 借鉴 MiniMind“用小模型复现大模型训练流程”的思路，但以 Rust 为核心，从最底层的张量开始重新组织。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid--3">
        {PRINCIPLES.map((principle, index) => (
          <article class="card">
            <span class="card__index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <h3 class="card__title">{principle.title}</h3>
            <p class="card__text">{principle.text}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="path">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">02 · 计算路径</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">从一行数据，到一个注意力输出</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-note">
          没有框架魔法。形状校验、行优先内存、逐行 Softmax，全部是可以单步调试的普通 Rust 代码。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="path">
        <ol class="path__steps">
          <li>
            <span class="path__num">01</span>
            <div>
              <h3>张量是形状 + 一段连续内存</h3>
              <p>
                <code>Tensor::new(data, shape)</code> 检查 <code>shape.iter().product() == data.len()</code>。
                形状不合法的张量在构造时就会返回 <code>TensorError</code>，而不是在几十层之后才炸。
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="path__num">02</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Softmax 把分数变成分布</h3>
              <p>
                先减去每行最大值再取指数：数值稳定，且不改变结果。输出每一行的和恒为 1，
                这就是模型“在候选词上分配概率”的最小实现。
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="path__num">03</span>
            <div>
              <h3>注意力就是三次矩阵运算</h3>
              <p>
                <code>Q × Kᵀ / √d</code> 得到“每个 query 对每个 key 的关注分数”，按行 Softmax 成权重，
                再乘 <code>V</code> 得到混合后的表示。当前版本刻意不含 causal mask、多头与 KV cache。
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="path__code">
          <div class="path__code-head">
            <span class="mono">crates / demo.rs</span>
            <a class="mono" href="/docs/architecture">架构约定 →</a>
          </div>
          <Code code={snippet} lang="rust" theme="github-dark-dimmed" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="learn">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">03 · 概念图解</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">拖动参数，把抽象概念变成手感</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-note">
          三个可以交互的小实验。每个都对应仓库里已经跑通的代码，而不是另一个玩具实现。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid--3">
        {LESSONS.map((lesson) => <LessonCard lesson={lesson} />)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="roadmap">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">04 · 路线图</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">一个里程碑，一个可验证的能力</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-note">
          每个 milestone 都要有可运行示例、测试、形状说明和明确的限制。当前停在 M0 与 M1 之间。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="roadmap">
        {ROADMAP.map((item) => (
          <div class="roadmap__item" data-state={item.state}>
            <span class="roadmap__id">{item.id}</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="roadmap__title">
                <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                {item.title}
              </h3>
              <p class="roadmap__text">{item.text}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="start">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">05 · 快速开始</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">四条命令，跑通第一遍</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-note">
          只需要 Rust stable。站点本身用 Astro 构建，但它只是文档与演示层，不参与训练。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="quickstart">
        <ol class="step-list">
          <li>
            <div>
              <h3>编译并跑测试</h3>
              <p><code>cargo test</code></p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div>
              <h3>看一次注意力输出</h3>
              <p><code>cargo run -p mini-llm-cli -- demo</code></p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div>
              <h3>检查默认模型配置</h3>
              <p><code>cargo run -p mini-llm-cli -- inspect-config</code></p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div>
              <h3>启动这个站点</h3>
              <p><code>cd web &amp;&amp; pnpm install &amp;&amp; pnpm dev</code></p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="tree">
          <div class="tree__head">workspace</div>
          <pre class="tree__body"><code>mini-llm/
├── Cargo.toml
├── crates/
│   ├── mini-llm-tensor/   <span class="c-dim">CPU Tensor · Add · MatMul · Softmax</span>
│   ├── mini-llm-model/    <span class="c-dim">config · scaled dot-product attention</span>
│   └── mini-llm-cli/      <span class="c-dim">demo · inspect-config</span>
├── docs/                  <span class="c-dim">架构、数学、Tensor Engine、路线图</span>
└── web/                   <span class="c-dim">Astro 站点：概念图解 + 文档</span></code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="closing">
        <p>准备好了就从张量开始。读不懂的地方，回到文档里对应的一节。</p>
        <div class="closing__actions">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/learn/tensor-shape">
            打开第一个实验 <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/docs/math-foundations">先补数学基础</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero code,
  .path code,
  .closing code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.86em;
    padding: 0.12em 0.38em;
    border-radius: 5px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--code-bg);
  }

  .console__heat {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 4px 18px 18px;
  }

  .heat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 46px);
    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 46px);
    gap: 4px;
    flex: none;
  }

  .heat-cell {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    background: rgba(255, 122, 69, calc(0.1 + var(--w) * 0.62));
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .heat-caption {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #6f7a82;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  /* 02 path */

  .path {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.02fr) minmax(0, 0.98fr);
    gap: 44px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .path__steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    counter-reset: path;
  }

  .path__steps li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 40px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 22px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .path__steps li:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .path__steps li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .path__num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--accent);
    padding-top: 4px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .path__steps h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 16.5px;
    font-weight: 620;
    letter-spacing: -0.012em;
  }

  .path__steps p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.78;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .path__code {
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--header-h) + 24px);
    border: 1px solid #262e34;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: #0d1114;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .path__code-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 11px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1e262c;
    background: #11171b;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #7c878f;
  }

  .path__code-head a {
    color: #9fb0ba;
  }

  .path__code-head a:hover {
    color: #ff8a5c;
  }

  .path__code :global(pre) {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 18px;
    background: #0d1114;
    font-size: 12.6px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  /* closing */

  .closing {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 44px;
    padding: 26px 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--paper-2);
  }

  .closing p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 44ch;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .closing__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .tree {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--paper-2);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .tree__head {
    padding: 11px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--paper-3);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .tree__body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    overflow-x: auto;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .tree__body .c-dim {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .path {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .path__code {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
